      ":question/worked-solution": "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nNotice that the matrix $M$ is already in row echelon form.\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\nR_{2}:=R_{2}-R_{3},\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}+3R_{3},\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}-2R_{2},\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$",
